{"abstract":[{"text":"Returns a sequence of pairs (","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"x"}]},{"type":"text","text":"), where "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" represents a"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"consecutive integer starting at zero and "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"x"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" represents an element of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the sequence."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode\/Scalar\/UTF16View\/enumerated()"},"metadata":{"platforms":[{"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"8.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"iPadOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"8.0","beta":false},{"name":"Mac Catalyst","introducedAt":"13.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"macOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"10.10","beta":false},{"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"9.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"visionOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","beta":false},{"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"2.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enumerated","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EnumeratedSequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18EnumeratedSequenceV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"extendedModule":"Swift","title":"enumerated()","modules":[{"name":"Swift"}],"symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:STsE10enumerateds18EnumeratedSequenceVyxGyF::SYNTHESIZED::s:s7UnicodeO6ScalarV9UTF16ViewV","roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swift\/unicode\/scalar\/utf16view\/enumerated()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode\/Scalar","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode\/Scalar\/UTF16View"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"enumerated"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"text":"EnumeratedSequence","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18EnumeratedSequenceV","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/EnumeratedSequence"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A sequence of pairs enumerating the sequence.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This example enumerates the characters of the string “Swift” and prints"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each character along with its place in the string."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["for (n, c) in \"Swift\".enumerated() {","    print(\"\\(n): '\\(c)'\")","}","\/\/ Prints \"0: 'S'\"","\/\/ Prints \"1: 'w'\"","\/\/ Prints \"2: 'i'\"","\/\/ Prints \"3: 'f'\"","\/\/ Prints \"4: 't'\""],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When you enumerate a collection, the integer part of each pair is a counter"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the enumeration, but is not necessarily the index of the paired value."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"These counters can be used as indices only in instances of zero-based,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"integer-indexed collections, such as "},{"code":"Array","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"ContiguousArray","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". For","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"other collections the counters may be out of range or of the wrong type","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to use as an index. To iterate over the elements of a collection with its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"indices, use the ","type":"text"},{"code":"zip(_:_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" function.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This example iterates over the indices and elements of a set, building a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"list consisting of indices of names with five or fewer letters.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let names: Set = [\"Sofia\", \"Camilla\", \"Martina\", \"Mateo\", \"Nicolás\"]","var shorterIndices: [Set<String>.Index] = []","for (i, name) in zip(names.indices, names) {","    if name.count <= 5 {","        shorterIndices.append(i)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Now that the ","type":"text"},{"code":"shorterIndices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" array holds the indices of the shorter","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"names in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"names","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" set, you can use those indices to access elements in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the set.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["for i in shorterIndices {","    print(names[i])","}","\/\/ Prints \"Sofia\"","\/\/ Prints \"Mateo\""],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(1)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","name":"Complexity","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/EnumeratedSequence":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EnumeratedSequence","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EnumeratedSequence","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/EnumeratedSequence","url":"\/documentation\/swift\/enumeratedsequence","title":"EnumeratedSequence","abstract":[{"text":"An enumeration of the elements of a sequence or collection.","type":"text"}]},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/Unicode/Scalar/UTF16View/enumerated()":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode\/Scalar\/UTF16View\/enumerated()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enumerated","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EnumeratedSequence","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18EnumeratedSequenceV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"enumerated()","abstract":[{"text":"Returns a sequence of pairs (","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"x","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":"), where ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" represents a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"consecutive integer starting at zero and ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"x","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" represents an element of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the sequence.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swift\/unicode\/scalar\/utf1